"use strict";(self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut=self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut||[]).push([["98382"],{217197(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":12567,"title":"\u964DAI","description":"You are an academic writing specialist with extensive experience in peer-reviewing for top-tier medical and scientific journals. Please perform a deep stylistic revision of the following AI-generated review paragraph, strictly following these guidelines:\\n\\nEliminate AI-typical structural patterns: Break up obvious enumerative structures such as \\"first\u2026 second\u2026 finally\u2026\\" or \\"on one hand\u2026 on the other hand\u2026\\" and replace them with natural logical progression. Remove templated openings like \\"With the advancement of\u2026 X has become a research hotspot\\" or \\"In recent years, increasing attention has been paid to\u2026\\"\\nRemove redundant and repetitive language: Avoid repeating the same nouns, verbs, or adjectives within a paragraph. Replace them with precise synonyms, suitable pronouns, or restructured sentences. No filler phrases \u2014 every word should carry weight.\\nCut clich\xe9d transitions and padding: Delete AI-typical connectives such as \\"Furthermore,\\" \\"Moreover,\\" \\"It is worth noting that,\\" \\"It is important to highlight that,\\" \\"Not only\u2026 but also\u2026\\" unless they are genuinely the most precise option. Prefer tighter, more implicit logical connectives, or allow the semantics to carry the transition naturally.\\nPurge hollow metaphors and ornamental language: Rewrite expressions like \\"serves as a cornerstone,\\" \\"opens the door to,\\" \\"plays a pivotal role in,\\" \\"sheds new light on,\\" and similar inflated phrasings into plain, objective academic statements. Retain an analogy only when it genuinely aids conceptual clarity \u2014 and even then, keep it precise and restrained.\\nStrengthen academic rigor and logical flow:\\n\\nMake the causal, contrastive, or progressive relationships between claims and evidence explicit and tight \u2014 every sentence should advance a clear logical purpose.\\nUse field-standard terminology accurately; avoid colloquialisms or vague abstractions.\\nEnsure subject-verb-object structure is clear in each sentence. Use subordinate clauses and parentheticals judiciously to convey nuance, but do not pile up complex sentences. Prefer shorter, well-constructed sentences over long, clause-heavy ones.\\nEach paragraph must open with a clear topic sentence and close with a specific inference, illustration, or conclusion \u2014 not a vague summary.\\n\\n\\nImprove sentence-level naturalness:\\n\\nFavor active voice over passive where appropriate, to keep agency clear.\\nVary sentence length deliberately: a mix of short declarative sentences and mid-length analytical ones creates readable rhythm. Avoid uniformly long sentences.\\nWhere natural, occasional hedging language (e.g., \\"in most cases,\\" \\"this suggests,\\" \\"arguably\\") can signal epistemic precision rather than false certainty \u2014 but use sparingly.\\n\\n\\nPreserve original meaning absolutely: Do not introduce information absent from the source text. Do not distort the author\'s original academic arguments or the conclusions of cited literature. If severe logical gaps exist in the original, you may minimally reorganize for coherence, without altering substance.\\n\\nOutput only the revised paragraph. Do not explain or annotate your changes.\\n\\n[Paste your paragraph here]","owner":"15819677920","upvotes":1,"downvotes":0,"upvoteDifference":1,"updatedAt":"2026-05-12T04:43:04.890Z"}')}}]);